      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WhiteShot-Einstellungen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WhiteShot could not check for updates: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WhiteShot konnte nicht nach Updates suchen: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WhiteShot lives in your menu bar. Press %@ to capture a region of the screen.\n\nmacOS will now ask for permission to record your screen. WhiteShot needs it to take screenshots, and nothing ever leaves your Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WhiteShot lebt in deiner Menüleiste. Drücke %@, um einen Bereich des Bildschirms aufzunehmen.\n\nmacOS fragt dich jetzt nach der Erlaubnis, deinen Bildschirm aufzunehmen. WhiteShot braucht sie für Screenshots, und nichts verlässt jemals deinen Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WhiteShot needs permission to record your screen": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WhiteShot braucht die Erlaubnis, deinen Bildschirm aufzunehmen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WhiteShot on GitHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WhiteShot auf GitHub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WhiteShot only asks GitHub whether a newer release exists and never installs anything by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WhiteShot fragt bei GitHub nur nach, ob es eine neuere Version gibt, und installiert nie etwas von selbst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WhiteShot’s menus and windows will switch to %@ after it restarts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Menüs und Fenster von WhiteShot wechseln nach dem Neustart zu %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WhiteShot’s own (⌃⇧)": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eigene von WhiteShot (⌃⇧)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Width": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Breite"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Window": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fenster"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Window capture": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fensteraufnahme"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Window title of the captured window": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fenstertitel des aufgenommenen Fensters"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year, four digits": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jahr, vierstellig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year, two digits": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jahr, zweistellig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have version %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast Version %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your changes will be lost if you don’t save them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Änderungen gehen verloren, wenn du sie nicht sicherst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your user name": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Benutzername"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re up to date": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du bist auf dem neuesten Stand"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zoom": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zoomen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zoom In": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hineinzoomen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zoom Out": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Herauszoomen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS still uses %@ for its own screenshots, so WhiteShot won’t receive it. Turn those off in System Settings › Keyboard › Keyboard Shortcuts › Screenshots.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS verwendet %@ weiterhin für seine eigenen Screenshots, daher erhält WhiteShot diese Kürzel nicht. Schalte sie in Systemeinstellungen › Tastatur › Tastaturkurzbefehle › Bildschirmfotos aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "px": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "·": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "“%@” could not be opened as an image.": {
      "localizations": {
